# CampusFlow AI — Phase 1 environment template
#
# Phase 1 is fully local: there is no backend, no AI provider and no database.
# This file exists to document where credentials would go later, and to make
# clear that NONE are required right now.
#
# Rules:
#   - Never commit a real .env file (see .gitignore).
#   - Never expose secrets through Vite. Only variables prefixed with VITE_
#     reach the browser bundle, and those must never be secret.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Not used in Phase 1. Listed for roadmap clarity only. Leave unset.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# AI provider — planned, provider-independent. Phase 1 ships no AI calls.
# VITE_AI_PROVIDER=your-provider-id
# AI_API_KEY is a SECRET and must NEVER be prefixed with VITE_ or committed.

# Backend — planned. Phase 1 uses local mock data only.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-api.example.com
